{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-essay-rubric-check#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-essay-rubric-check","commit":"49d8e44fb627fcd7b2e1da8c2a3ceed70076b32e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-essay-rubric-check 是面向作文评分表核对的 DSH 插件，在 DSH 工具面注册 essay_rubric_check。它读取 JSON 或 YAML 文件或内联材料，按可替换的规则包检查评分项填写、分值上限、得分与总分关系、原文定位、序号唯一和表头字段，并返回带差异位置、级别、摘要及跳过项目的报告。适合教师、教研员和阅卷组核对评分表自身的一致性；它不判断作文质量或评分是否恰当。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-91"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-essay-rubric-check#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-essay-rubric-check","commit":"49d8e44fb627fcd7b2e1da8c2a3ceed70076b32e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-essay-rubric-check reads JSON or YAML rubric sheets and reports missing fields, score or total mismatches, missing evidence locations, duplicate item numbers, and absent header fields. Its configurable checks help teachers review rubric consistency; it does not judge essays or grades.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-91"]}
